OL,3,GNEWSAMore training for Neets welcomed
OL,4,Aby young people
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to give young people not in
OL,7,Feducation, employment or training
OL,8,F(Neet) more opportunities and support
OL,9,Fhave been welcomed by those in
OL,10,Fnorth-east England and Cumbria.
OL,12,FAbout one million people are classed as
OL,13,FNeet in the UK, and a report by former
OL,14,FLabour MP Alan Milburn has outlined how
OL,15,Fto get more of them into work.
OL,17,FThe issue is particularly bad in the
OL,18,FNorth East, which Mayor Kim McGuinness
OL,19,Fsaid had "by some margin" the highest
OL,20,Frates of Neets in the country.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
