OL,3,GNEWSAMore training for Neets welcomed
OL,4,Aby young people
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said young people looking for work
OL,7,F"feel let down" and politicians needed
OL,8,Fto "give them hope", which she believed
OL,9,Fwould be possible by giving regions
OL,10,Fmore devolved powers.
